<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>📄 Documents &amp; Templates</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Tutoring agreement / contract</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Invoice template</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Parent intake form</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Rate sheet / service menu PDF</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">ESA reimbursement tracking spreadsheet</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>📱 Social Media</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Facebook/Instagram post templates</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">A month's worth of content ideas</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Caption writing for posts</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Bio copy for all platforms</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>📧 Email Templates</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Welcome email for new clients</li>
