<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">ESA onboarding instructions for parents</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Invoice follow-up</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>🌐 Website Updates</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add your bio + photo section</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add a booking/Calendly button</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add a rates/pricing page</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Make it mobile-optimized</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>📋 Business Operations</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">ESA vendor application tracker (spreadsheet)</li>
