<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>SEO description</strong> — what Google shows under your site name in search results</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Keywords</strong> — helps parents find you searching "ESA tutor Arizona" etc.</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Open Graph tags</strong> — controls how your site looks when shared on Facebook, iMessage, etc. (title, description, preview image)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Twitter/X card</strong> — same but for Twitter</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Canonical URL</strong> — tells Google your official domain</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Author/business info</strong></li>
